st of the CSS…"]],0,265],[7236047,20431,209,4.536,3.643,[[16,0.575,37,123],[4,0.289,80,63],[8,0.096,105,16],[3,0.031,132,6],[20,0.009,0,1]],[["033658c7_6423e7f1",44,-1,1,"optional: shorten since this is already in the context of a `composebox` file. ```suggestion <cr-button id=\"lensSearch\" class=\"lens-search\" ```"],["03639a84_ce8024be",45,-1,1,"optional: could shorten these querySelector calls if you import $$ from `chrome://webui-test/test_util.js` ```suggestion const button = $$(lensSearch, 'cr-button'); ```"],["42017fe0_ad40e92f",46,-1,1,"Should be protected and moved closer to `showRecentTabChip_` as it is should be set by the loadtimedata. The other composeboxes would then set `composeboxShowLensChip` to false e.g. [1], to prevent a…"],["697b9747_d318a58e",47,-1,1,"Few things: 1. Since this is hardcoded, you should just apply it right in the HTML, like [1]. To test the value of the \"label\" in the test, check the trimmed `textContent` e.g. [3]. 2. Same as [1],…"],["880f4ac3_c3cd10c8",39,-1,1,"nit: `contextual-chip` doesn't accurately describe the \"image upload button\" (in the html.ts file). I think we should either: a) rename this to something comprehensive, like `.upload-button` OR b)…"],["941a47a5_7b2038d5",48,-1,1,"nit: remove extra line to remain in line with file's styling"],["970e2af5_44cf5788",45,-1,0,"nit: Can this be moved inside of the test that uses it?"],["9b400fd0_6ebd5e95",49,-1,1,"Few things. 1. This should be moved to the shared localized string list for searchboxes[1], otherwise we risk those searchboxes crashing if other composebox owners decide to surface this chip. 2.…"],["c9510165_127014fe",46,-1,1,"Remove new line ```suggestion protected accessor submitButtonShown: boolean = false; protected get inToolMode_(): boolean { ```"],["e2c8b625_52ceedec",46,-1,1,"Is this needed? I don't think it is doing anything."],["eae76c7c_1890bcdf",44,-1,1,"does this need both an id and a class attribute, since they both are being used for one thing? ```suggestion <cr-button id=\"composeboxLensSearch\" ```"],["ee70792f_bdab1d14",44,-1,1,"optional: can be shortened since in a `composebox` context already ```suggestion @click=\"${this.onLensSearchClick_}\"> ```"],["f85df637_a70c2099",50,-1,1,"Move this to where the rest of the composebox strings are, which starts on line 330."],["f8b0e9a6_f8e7e6da",51,-1,0,"Good call on making it this way so the NTP team knows to add their own colors if they ever want to make their own version of this chip + make its easy to share between this and the other chips."],["fbdfe447_5c2e4c42",46,-1,1,"nit: remove this method in this CL, and allow Khalid to add it in his own. In case the click handling ends up not needing to be routed through here."]],0,266],[7254699,20434,11,0.523,0.339,[[16,0.6,38,7],[8,0.267,106,3],[3,0.133,133,1]],[["f56854e2_8c17afed",52,0,0,"Do we not want the ability to toggle this via some feature param?"]],0,267],[7256994,20435,8,0.517,0.366,[[4,0.8,81,7],[16,0.2,39,0]],[["55e81d48_bf04f605",53,0,1,"optional: consider shortening test and removing the extra tab info since we just want to make sure nothing shwos"],["5d87c031_ac0ee44a",53,0,1,"nit: can probably remove this test altogether"],["cc3852c1_ae46bac6",53,0,1,"nit: test needs to be renamed"]],0,268],[7263844,20438,2,0.197,0.133,[[3,134]],[],0,269],[7269357,20439,77,2.643,2.172,[[4,0.885,82,68],[16,0.115,40,8]],[],0,270],[7272486,20440,1,0.17,0.089,[[16,40]],[],0,270],[7278416,20440,1,0.116,0.083,[[2,32]],[],0,271],[7308888,20445,9,0.523,0.339,[[16,0.818,41,8],[3,0.182,135,1]],[],0,272],[7309291,20446,64,2.603,2.175,[[16,0.704,42,45],[3,0.296,136,19]],[["2e19be6d_4ae57921",48,-1,1,"Nit: showContextualChipsInCompactMode"],["684252e6_ad283c5c",48,-1,1,"Don't think this can change? Maybe this should depend on tabSuggestions? And then you use the compute method on line 300?"]],0,273],[7364057,20453,3,0.17,0.089,[[16,0.6,43,2],[3,0.4,137,1]],[],0,274]]}